{"id":"49cfb3511a1d1124","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-bounded-search.md","title":"有界搜索","display":"df-bounded-search — 有界搜索","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-bounded-search","aliases":["18-df-bounded-search"],"display":"df-bounded-search — 有界搜索","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.2.7","source_printed_pages":"15","source_pdf_pages":"26","source_correspondence":"exercise-with-local-proof-outline","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-bounded-search"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-bounded-search</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-search — 有界搜索"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc21fff5179104fc\" href=\"?note=dc21fff5179104fc\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"26"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"exercise-with-local-proof-outline"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,x\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,x\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{n+1}\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,\\vec z)=\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec z\">\\((y,\\vec z)=\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec z\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\le}P:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mu_{\\le}P:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 由下式引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> 及本书函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}^{18}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc21fff5179104fc\" href=\"?note=dc21fff5179104fc\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation\">18-df-primitive-recursive-relation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mu_{\\le}P)(x,\\vec z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{y\\le x:(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}\n&amp;\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P,\\\\\nx+1&amp;\\neg\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mu_{\\le}P)(x,\\vec z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{y\\le x:(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}\n&amp;\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P,\\\\\nx+1&amp;\\neg\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\Longrightarrow\\mu_{\\le}P\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\Longrightarrow\\mu_{\\le}P\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Exercise 2.2.7；无见证时返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span>，因此为全函数。局部证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\displaystyle(\\mu_{\\le}P)(x,\\vec z)=\\sum_{i=0}^{x}\\prod_{j=0}^{i}(1-\\chi_P(j,\\vec z))\">\\(\\displaystyle(\\mu_{\\le}P)(x,\\vec z)=\\sum_{i=0}^{x}\\prod_{j=0}^{i}(1-\\chi_P(j,\\vec z))\\)</span>。若首个见证为m，则只有i&lt;m的m项积为1；若没有见证，则全部x+1项为1。有限和、有限积与复合封闭性因此给出所列本原递归性。原书将其列为练习，本节点不冒充已阅读的书中证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation","status":"resolved","id":"dc21fff5179104fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-relation","status":"resolved","id":"dc21fff5179104fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu_{\\le}P:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 由下式引入；$\\mathrm{PRPred}$ 及本书函数类 $\\mathrm{PR}^{18}$ 见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-relation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,x\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"(y,\\vec z)=\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\le}P:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}^{18}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mu_{\\le}P)(x,\\vec z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{y\\le x:(y,\\vec z)\\in P\\}\n&\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P,\\\\\nx+1&\\neg\\exists y\\le x\\;(y,\\vec z)\\in P.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{n+1}\\Longrightarrow\\mu_{\\le}P\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_{n+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"x+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\displaystyle(\\mu_{\\le}P)(x,\\vec z)=\\sum_{i=0}^{x}\\prod_{j=0}^{i}(1-\\chi_P(j,\\vec z))","display":false}],"bytes":1594,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-bounded-search]]"},{"id":"b2ce8b00b90479d8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是保留既有笔记对象的辅助定义，不是原书 Exercise 2.2.7 的有界搜索。原稿对空见证集直接写 min，现由部分函数图明确其定义域；每个非空自然数见证集有唯一最小元。有界版本见 [[18-df-bounded-search]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bounded-search]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-bounded-search]]"}],"outgoing":["dc21fff5179104fc"]}